# suite=memmap; columns: <FAULT_ID> <must-fail> <allowed-prefixes> <must-pass>
# Memory-map named faults (D-37, plans 03-04 and 03-06). GEN_MAP_MUTATION is a generator-path
# control (no site; the mutated ivs_profiles.inc is consumed by core/src/memmap/memsys.c); every
# other id has one IVS_FAULT_<ID> site in core/src/memmap/memsys.c. The last five (plan 03-06)
# are the width and gate rules, each caught by a literal-row case (memmap.row.*, memmap.row-gate.*).
# Plan 05-04: the PSG region became a real 16-word device, so MEM_MIRROR_MASK (which halves the backing index
# of every region) also breaks the PSG literal rows and the neighbour probe of the $0200 write row.
GEN_MAP_MUTATION memmap.anchor.sysram-lo memmap.anchor.sysram-|memmap.describe.|memmap.dump.|memmap.row. memmap.bus.iab-reset
MEM_UNDRIVEN_ZERO memmap.unloaded.exec-reads-ffff memmap.unloaded.|memmap.width.undriven-|memmap.gate.|memmap.cart.|memmap.anchor.stic-alias-w|memmap.anchor.gram-alias-w|memmap.row.|memmap.row-gate. memmap.bus.iab-reset
MEM_CART_END_INCLUSIVE memmap.cart.above-5001 memmap.cart. memmap.bus.iab-reset
MEM_WO_READS_DEVICE memmap.anchor.gram-alias-w7-lo memmap.anchor.gram-alias-w|memmap.unloaded.cart-|memmap.cart. memmap.bus.iab-reset
MEM_MIRROR_MASK memmap.mirror.gram-3a00 memmap.mirror.|memmap.dump.|memmap.row.R-01F|memmap.row.W-01F|memmap.row.W-0200- memmap.bus.iab-reset
MEM_IAB_VECTOR_SWAPPED memmap.bus.iab-reset memmap.bus.iab- memmap.anchor.exec-lo
MEM_ROM_NO_MASK memmap.row.R-1000-1FFF memmap.row.|memmap.width.|memmap.anchor.|memmap.dump. memmap.bus.iab-reset
MEM_RAM8_NO_TRUNC memmap.row.W-0100-01EF memmap.row.|memmap.row-gate. memmap.bus.iab-reset
MEM_RAM16_TRUNC memmap.row.W-0200-035F memmap.row.|memmap.width.|memmap.anchor.|memmap.dump.|memmap.bus.|memmap.gate. memmap.cart.one-word-5000
MEM_ROM_WRITABLE memmap.row.W-0360-37FF memmap.row.|memmap.anchor.|memmap.dump. memmap.bus.iab-reset
MEM_GATE_IGNORED memmap.row-gate.gmem-closed memmap.row-gate.|memmap.gate. memmap.bus.iab-reset
# Review WR-05: MEM_DROPPED_WRITE_KEPT keeps a store to $0080-$008F (inside the width-0 undriven
# write row 0040-00FF, away from the edge addresses the per-row cases read) in system RAM words
# that are zero when the probe runs, with no change to the decode description; the former
# single FFFF-then-0000 sweep ended on the zero they held and missed it. Only the dropped-write probe, which compares the whole state
# after a FFFF sweep and after a 0000 sweep of the row, can see it; that row's own case and the
# dump both run it.
MEM_DROPPED_WRITE_KEPT memmap.row.W-0040-00FF memmap.row.W-0040-00FF|memmap.dump.matches-literal memmap.bus.iab-reset
